ginal":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p=Hd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"417b23ee-44c0-4d27-9ee1-69b96f4dad07","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"```export ASDF_DATA_DIR=$XDG_DATA_HOME/asdf; zpm load asdf-vm/asdf,apply:source,hook:\"sed -i '1s/^/0=\\$ZERO\\n/' asdf.sh\",source:asdf.sh```\nブックオブジエンド（sed）","ts":"1635753143.265300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"im1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8373f2cc-a90d-4be9-af62-e5edb5eef8da","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"やっぱり独自管理が一番","ts":"1635753088.264700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pyb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"194af932-28f8-43c1-b65d-0a49534b803d","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"うーん、邪悪さのニュアンスが難しい\nsedでスクリプトに一行処理を挟み込んだのでどちらかというと死神的","ts":"1635753083.264400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iskQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0dc98705-a4c8-4759-ae17-0d77881792ad","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"devil な感じ?","ts":"1635753008.263000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kdvy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5f68feb-3f63-4372-8388-0b6e99ae0a90","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"zpm、そのままだとasdfが動かないのでこれ以上ないほどevilなハックを仕掛けた","ts":"1635752956.262600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R2St/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06bca575-d799-4666-88e3-3ae5322a8fad","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"\u003c@U8996GYBF\u003e \u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/zeno.zsh/pull/43\u003e\nを rebase して、複雑な awk を perl に置き換えました。","ts":"1635752674.261700","thread_ts":"1635726075.234200","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/zeno.zsh/pull/43|#43 Fixed shell evaluation\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/zeno.zsh/pull/43|#43 Fixed shell evaluation\u003e","text":"• Parsing results uses too many pipes and commands. So refactored with shell evaluation.\n• Fixed to work correctly even if the result path contains spaces or quotes.\n• Only used `$ZENO_FZF_TMUX_OPTIONS` when `$ZENO_ENABLE_FZF_TMUX` is set.","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/zeno.zsh|yuki-yano/zeno.zsh\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1635306138}],"subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y56a"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"573403c2-3c9d-48c5-bd45-7c76cb963e31","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c@UP6PA1UBE\u003e perlの方が互換性って意味で信頼度あると思うんですがどうでしょう","ts":"1635726075.234200","thread_ts":"1635726075.234200","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fNsHk"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"af0e8ad9-0e6e-4e78-8a66-1501949576a0","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"`$@` の各要素について `//\\\"/\\\\\\\"` (`\"` を `\\\"` に置換) して `\"` で囲んだものを `args` に配列として入れます。\n\n`^` は展開を bash 互換にしてくれます。\n`@=(foo bar); args=( X$@Y )` の結果は `Xfoo barY`\n`@=(foo bar); args=( X${^@}Y )` の結果は `XfooY XbarY`\nになります。","ts":"1635747190.261300","thread_ts":"1635743380.260800","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UBNPMJJGM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"inOc"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"6948eee4-b40c-4dda-be4a-67e311a75c10","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"`args=('\"'${^@//\\\"/\\\\\\\"}'\"')` 無理・・・","ts":"1635743380.260800","thread_ts":"1635743380.260800","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"75Pkl"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"6948eee4-b40c-4dda-be4a-67e311a75c10","ty