":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"むむ、何の補完ですか zeno-completion ？","ts":"1635742963.257300","thread_ts":"1635725999.233300","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"51IVA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96c413f6-5a4c-4019-b123-9bd09b850a28","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"補完じゃないですね、cdして\n```function zeno-onchpwd() {\n  zeno-client \"--zeno-mode=chdir $(pwd)\"\n}```\nが発火したタイミングです","ts":"1635742987.257500","thread_ts":"1635725999.233300","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cg=I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82808910-7c55-42c8-9acb-8580850128ca","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"2つの引数として評価しないといけないのがスペースを含んだ1つの引数として渡されてるんだと思います","ts":"1635743014.257700","thread_ts":"1635725999.233300","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZEy3n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf2357b3-5dba-4b79-900e-f7ce4d5edd78","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"修正もれでした","ts":"1635743066.257900","thread_ts":"1635725999.233300","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zHuJp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc6d6b61-6539-45d5-8c90-31733164dbbd","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"```  zeno-client --zeno-mode=chdir --input=\"$(pwd)\"```\nにすれば直りますね","ts":"1635743082.258100","thread_ts":"1635725999.233300","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1sX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f00dafe-1f1b-4b62-b663-b365f5579923","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"お、ありがとうございます","ts":"1635743089.258300","thread_ts":"1635725999.233300","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":fals